source.quote:
Any $\delta$-correct strategy satisfies \eqref{eq:gen.lbd} with
  \[
  T^*(\vmu) ~=~
  \begin{cases}
    \frac{1}{d(\mu^*, \gamma)}
    & \mu^* < \gamma
    ,
    \\
    \sum_a \frac{1}{d(\mu_a, \gamma)}
    & \mu^* > \gamma
    ,
  \end{cases}
  \qquad
  \text{and}
  \qquad
  w^*_a(\vmu)
  ~=~
  \begin{cases}
    \mathbf 1_{a=a^*} & \mu^* < \gamma
    ,
    \\
    \frac{\frac{1}{d(\mu_a, \gamma)}}{\sum_j \frac{1}{d(\mu_j, \gamma)}}
    & \mu^* > \gamma
    .
  \end{cases}
\]
